ent-DeathRattleImplantCybersun = Last Breath
    .desc = A Cybersun corporate implant. When the carrier is critically injured or dies, the report is broadcast on the Cybersun channel from the corporation's own relay, along with exact coordinates. Nobody outside Cybersun comms will ever hear it.
ent-DeathRattleImplanterCybersun = "Last Breath" implanter
cybersun-deathrattle-implant-critical-message = Asset vitals critical. {$user} requires extraction: {$position}.
cybersun-deathrattle-implant-dead-message = Asset lost. {$user} flatlined at {$position}.
